{
"id": 5006,
"iid": 14,
"project_id": 3305,
"title": "UDR: shift in parsing of AM request",
"description": "UDR: wrong parsing of AM request.\n- UDM \n```\n[2025-06-30 06:46:57.396] [udm_server] [debug] QueryString: plmn-id={\"mcc\":\"001\",\"mnc\":\"01\"}\n[2025-06-30 06:46:57.396] [udm_sdm] [debug] Handle Slice Selection Subscription Data Retrieval request\n[2025-06-30 06:46:57.396] [udm_sdm] [debug] Remote URI: http://oai-udr:8080/nudr-dr/v1/subscription-data/001010000000001/00101/provisioned-data/am-data\n[2025-06-30 06:46:57.396] [udm_client] [debug] Send a simple HTTP request\n[2025-06-30 06:46:57.396] [udm_sdm] [debug] HTTP response code 500\n[2025-06-30 06:46:57.396] [udm_sdm] [debug] Response from UDR: null\n[\n```\n- UDR\n```\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.653] [udr_app] [info] [UE Id 001010000000001] Store the Authentication Status data of an UE\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.653] [udr_db] [info] [UE Id 001010000000001] MySQL query: SELECT * FROM AuthenticationStatus WHERE ueid='001010000000001'\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.653] [udr_db] [info] [UE Id 001010000000001] MySQL query: UPDATE AuthenticationStatus SET nfInstanceId='400346f4-087e-40b1-a4cd-00566953999d',success=1,timeStamp                 ='2025-06-30T04:12:17Z',authType='5G_AKA',servingNetworkName='5G:mnc001.mcc001.3gppnetwork.org',authRemovalInd=0 WHERE ueid='001010000000001'\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.654] [udr_db] [info] [UE Id 001010000000001] AuthenticationStatus PUT: {\"authRemovalInd\":false,\"authType\":\"5G_AKA\",\"nfInstanceId\":\"400346f4-087e-40b1-a4cd-005669                 53999d\",\"servingNetworkName\":\"5G:mnc001.mcc001.3gppnetwork.org\",\"success\":true,\"timeStamp\":\"2025-06-30T04:12:17Z\"}\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.654] [udr_app] [info] [UE Id 001010000000001] Successful stored the Authentication Status data\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.654] [udr_server] [debug] HTTP Response code 204 (HTTP Version 2).\n\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.669] [udr_server] [debug] QueryString:\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.669] [udr_app] [info] [UE Id 00101] Retrieve the access and mobility subscription data of an UE (ID 00101)\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.669] [udr_db] [debug] [UE Id 00101] Handle Query AM Data\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.669] [udr_db] [debug] [UE Id 00101] SQL Query: SELECT * from AccessAndMobilitySubscriptionData WHERE ueid='00101' AND servingPlmnid=''\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.669] [udr_db] [error] [UE Id 00101] No data available for AccessAndMobilitySubscriptionData!\n[2025-06-30 06:12:17.669] [udr_server] [debug] HTTP Response code 500 (HTTP Version 2).\n\n```\nBelow might be a fix:\n```\ndiff --git a/src/api_server/udr-http2-server.cpp b/src/api_server/udr-http2-server.cpp\nindex a6e1cd6..940fd2c 100644\n--- a/src/api_server/udr-http2-server.cpp\n+++ b/src/api_server/udr-http2-server.cpp\n@@ -122,11 +122,13 @@ void udr_http2_server::start() {\n             }\n             if (split_q[split_q.size() - 1].compare(NUDR_DR_AM_DATA) == 0) {\n               if (request.method().compare(\"GET\") == 0 && len == 0) {\n-                std::string ueId = split_q[split_q.size() - 3].c_str();\n+                std::string ueId = split_q[split_q.size() - 4].c_str();\n+                std::string servingPlmnId = split_q[split_q.size() - 3].c_str();\n                 std::string qs   = request.uri().raw_query;\n                 Logger::udr_server().debug(\"QueryString: %s\", qs.c_str());\n-                std::string servingPlmnId =\n-                    oai::utils::get_query_param(qs, \"servingPlmnId\");\n                 this->query_am_data_handler(ueId, servingPlmnId, response);\n               }\n             }\n\n```",
